cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
message: "Please cite this software repository when using its code or saved numerical tables. The associated manuscript is currently unpublished."
title: "Retinal Vessel Flow Refinement with OOF Inputs"
authors:
  - family-names: Bayanian
    given-names: Babak
  - family-names: Naderi
    given-names: Hanieh
  - family-names: Dinesh
    given-names: Chinthaka
date-released: "2026-11-16"
url: "https://github.com/thebabak/retinal-vessel-flow-refinement-oof"
repository-code: "https://github.com/thebabak/retinal-vessel-flow-refinement-oof"
abstract: >-
  Research implementation and saved numerical tables for three separately
  evaluated retinal-vessel refinement recipes using retained out-of-fold
  coarse maps: Direct refinement with thin recovery and anchoring,
  error-selective flow matching with full local endpoint supervision and
  anchoring, and native-input patch Direct refinement. The associated
  manuscript, Structural Objectives and Native-Resolution Patches for Direct
  and Flow-Matching Retinal Vessel Refinement, by Babak Bayanian,
  Hanieh Naderi and Chinthaka Dinesh is unpublished. No manuscript DOI is
  asserted.
keywords:
  - retinal vessel segmentation
  - flow matching
  - out-of-fold predictions
  - native-resolution patches
  - reproducibility
